  "content": "\n以下是根据您的要求创建的洁家家政网站的文件内容：\n\n===== FILE: index.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>洁家家政</title>\n<style>\n  body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  .header { background: #333; color: #fff; padding: 10px 0; text-align: center; }\n  .nav { background: #444; color: #fff; padding: 10px 0; }\n  .nav a { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 0 15px; }\n  .container { width: 80%; margin: auto; }\n  .footer { background: #333; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 10px 0; position: relative; bottom: 0; width: 100%; }\n  .banner { text-align: center; padding: 20px 0; }\n  .banner h1 { margin: 0; }\n  .services { padding: 20px 0; }\n  .service-item { background: #f0f0f0; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .service-item h2 { margin: 0; }\n  .service-item p { margin: 0; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <h1>洁家家政</h1>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nav\">\n  <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n  <a href=\"services.html\">服务项目</a>\n  <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a>\n  <a href=\"reservation.html\">预约服务</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"banner\">\n    <h1>专业保洁，洁净生活</h1>\n    <p>洁家家政，您身边的清洁专家</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"services\">\n    <div class=\"service-item\">\n      <h2>日常保洁</h2>\n      <p>包括打扫卫生、清洁厨房、卫生间等。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"service-item\">\n      <h2>深度保洁</h2>\n      <p>提供深度清洁服务，让您家焕然一新。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"service-item\">\n      <h2>特殊服务</h2>\n      <p>针对特殊需求提供定制化清洁服务。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer\">\n  <p>&copy; 2023 洁家家政</p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: services.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>洁家家政 - 服务项目</title>\n<!-- ... Same CSS as in index.html ... -->\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- ... Same HTML structure as in index.html ... -->\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"banner\">\n    <h1>我们的服务项目</h1>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"services\">\n    <h2>日常保洁套餐</h2>\n    <p>套餐一：清洁一室，价格100元。</p>\n    <p>套餐二：清洁两室，价格150元。</p>\n    <h2>深度保洁套餐</h2>\n    <p>套餐一：清洁一室，价格200元。</p>\n    <p>套餐二：清洁两室，价格300元。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- ... Same HTML structure as in index.html ... -->\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: about.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>洁家家政 - 关于我们</title>\n<!-- ... Same CSS as in index.html ... -->\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- ... Same HTML structure as in index.html ... -->\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"banner\">\n    <h1>关于洁家家政</h1>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"services\">\n    <p>洁家家政成立于2000年，是一家专业的家庭保洁服务公司。我们秉承“专业、用心、高效”的服务理念，为北京地区的家庭提供优质的家政服务。</p>\n    <p>我们的服务团队由经过严格培训的专业人员组成，为您提供一对一的定制化清洁服务。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- ... Same HTML structure as in index.html ... -->\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: reservation.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<title>洁家家政 - 预约服务</title>\n<!-- ... Same CSS as in index.html ... -->\n</head>\n<body>\n<!-- ... Same HTML structure as in index.html ... -->\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"banner\">\n    <h1>预约保洁服务</h1>\n  </div>\n  <form action=\"#\" method=\"post\">\n    <label for=\"name\">姓名:</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" required>\n    <label for=\"phone\">电话:</label>\n    <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" name=\"phone\" required>\n    <label for=\"address\">地址:</label>\n    <input type=\"text\" id=\"address\" name=\"address\" required>\n    <label for=\"service\">服务类型:</label>\n    <select id=\"service\" name=\"service\">\n      <option value=\"daily\">日常保洁</option>\n      <option value=\"deep\">深度保洁</option>\n      <option value=\"special\">特殊服务</option>\n    </select>\n    <input type=\"submit\" value=\"提交预约\">\n  </form>\n</div>\n<!-- ... Same HTML structure as in index.html ... -->\n</body>\n</html>"
